{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44833","headline":"送吕郎中赴沧州 · 无可","name":"送吕郎中赴沧州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出守沧州去，西风送斾旌。\n路遥经几郡，地尽到孤城。\n拜庙千山绿，登楼遍海清。\n何人共东望，日向积涛生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}